OL,3,GNEWSAPolice failed me for decades, says
OL,4,Aabuse survivor
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman who was drugged and raped from
OL,7,Fthe age of 15 has spoken publicly for
OL,8,Fthe first time about police failures
OL,9,Fshe said allowed her abuser to evade
OL,10,Fjustice for more than 30 years.
OL,12,FTina Duggan sought help from
OL,13,Fauthorities during and after years of
OL,14,Fabuse by Frederick Allchorne, but says
OL,15,Fher allegations were not properly
OL,16,Finvestigated.
OL,18,FIn 2023, Allchorne was jailed for 22
OL,19,Fyears after admitting rape,
OL,20,Fadministering drugs with intent,
OL,21,Findecent assault and bigamy offences
OL,22,Fagainst her.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
