OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Metropolitan Police has since paid
OL,7,Fher compensation after settling a civil
OL,8,Fclaim over its handling of her original
OL,9,Fcomplaint, and acknowledged more should
OL,10,Fhave been done to protect her.
